Jenkins Installation and Setup – Explore the Environment
Aim
To install and configure Jenkins and explore its environment.
Description
Jenkins is an automation tool used in DevOps. It helps to automate the process of building, testing, and deploying software.
Jenkins Setup Steps
1. Install Jenkins
Download and install Jenkins on the system.
2. Start Jenkins
Start the Jenkins service after installation.
3. Open Jenkins in Browser
Open:
http://localhost:8080
4. Unlock Jenkins
Enter the initial administrator password.
5. Install Plugins
Select Install Suggested Plugins.
6. Create Admin User
Create a username and password and complete the setup.
